#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/search.md:1
msgid "Searching Satellite Data"
msgstr "搜索卫星数据"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/search.md:3
msgid ""
"Federated search across multiple providers simultaneously. Results are "
"deduplicated, scored, and returned sorted."
msgstr "同时跨多个提供方进行联合检索。结果会经过去重、评分并排序后返回。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/search.md:6
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概览"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/search.md:8
msgid ""
"A search begins with a description of what you are looking for, not with a "
"particular provider. You give pygeofetch an area (a bounding box or a "
"GeoJSON geometry), a date range and any filters that matter, such as maximum"
" cloud cover, satellite, processing level or resolution, and you name the "
"providers to ask. The same description is translated into each provider's "
"own API, the queries run in parallel, and the answers are merged into one "
"list of `SatelliteData` records that all look the same, whatever their "
"origin."
msgstr ""
"检索始于对所需内容的描述，而不是某个特定的提供方。您向 pygeofetch 提供一个区域（边界框或 GeoJSON "
"几何）、一个日期范围以及任何重要的过滤条件，例如最大云量、卫星、处理级别或分辨率，并指定要查询的提供方。同一描述会被转换为各提供方自己的 "
"API，查询并行运行，答案被合并为一个由 `SatelliteData` 记录组成的列表，无论来源如何，这些记录的形式都相同。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/search.md:10
msgid ""
"In practice a search session has three moves. Start broad, with a short list"
" of providers and a generous cloud-cover limit, to see how many scenes exist"
" and which satellites they come from. Narrow the query once you know what is"
" available, tightening dates or cloud cover until the list is a size you can"
" reason about. Then save the result, either as a GeoJSON file from the "
"command line or as the list returned by `client.search()` in Python, and "
"pass it to the download or streaming step. Results are cached for the "
"lifetime set by `cache_ttl`, so repeating a query while you refine "
"downstream steps does not cost another round trip."
msgstr ""
"实际上，一次检索通常有三个动作。先从宽泛开始，使用较短的提供方列表和较宽松的云量上限，了解有多少场景以及它们来自哪些卫星。在知道有哪些可用数据之后再收窄查询，收紧日期或云量，直到列表的大小便于您分析。然后保存结果，可以在命令行中保存为"
" GeoJSON 文件，也可以在 Python 中保存为 `client.search()` 返回的列表，并将其传给下载或流式读取步骤。结果会按 "
"`cache_ttl` 设定的时长缓存，因此在优化下游步骤时重复查询不会再产生额外的网络往返。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/search.md:12
msgid ""
"Two behaviours are useful to know before you rely on search in a script. A "
"provider that times out or fails is logged and left out rather than stopping"
" the search, so an empty list can mean that every provider failed, and the "
"log tells you which. And results are de-duplicated by provider and scene "
"identifier, so the same physical scene offered by two providers appears "
"twice; choose the provider you prefer for the download. The sections below "
"describe each filter and output format, and [Downloading](download.md) and "
"[Streaming](streaming.md) explain what to do with the results."
msgstr ""
"在脚本中依赖检索之前，有两点行为值得了解。超时或失败的提供方会被记录日志并被排除，而不会中止检索，因此空列表可能意味着所有提供方都失败了，日志会告诉您是哪些。此外，结果按提供方和场景标识符去重，因此由两个提供方提供的同一个实际场景会出现两次；请选择您偏好的提供方进行下载。下面各节介绍每个过滤条件和输出格式，[下载](download.md)和[流式读取](streaming.md)则说明如何处理这些结果。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/search.md:14
msgid "What \"federated search\" actually does"
msgstr "“联合检索”实际做了什么"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/search.md:16
msgid ""
"Searching across multiple providers isn't just \"call each one and "
"concatenate the results\" — three steps happen after the raw per-provider "
"results come back:"
msgstr "跨多个提供方检索并不只是“逐个调用再拼接结果”，在各提供方的原始结果返回之后还会发生三个步骤："

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/search.md:20
msgid ""
"**Per-provider search runs in parallel** (`max_search_workers`, default 8) —"
" a slow or unresponsive provider doesn't block the others; see `--on-"
"provider-failure` below for what happens if one errors out entirely."
msgstr ""
"**各提供方的检索并行运行**（`max_search_workers`，默认为 "
"8），缓慢或无响应的提供方不会阻塞其他提供方；如果某个提供方完全出错会怎样，请参阅下面的 `--on-provider-failure`。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/search.md:24
msgid ""
"**Deduplication** — removes exact duplicates, keyed on "
"`f\"{provider}:{scene_id}\"`."
msgstr "**去重**：移除完全重复的条目，以 `f\"{provider}:{scene_id}\"` 为键。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/search.md:26
msgid ""
"**Scoring** — every result gets a `0.0`-`1.0` relevance score, used for the "
"default sort order. The formula, verified against source:"
msgstr "**评分**：每个结果都会得到一个 `0.0` 到 `1.0` 的相关性分数，用于默认排序。以下公式已对照源代码验证："

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/search.md:0
msgid "Factor"
msgstr "因子"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/search.md:0
msgid "Weight"
msgstr "权重"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/search.md:0
msgid "How it's computed"
msgstr "计算方式"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/search.md:0
msgid "Cloud cover"
msgstr "云量"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/search.md:0
msgid "40%"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/search.md:0
msgid "`(100 - cloud_cover) / 100 * 0.4` — lower cloud cover scores higher"
msgstr "`(100 - cloud_cover) / 100 * 0.4`，云量越低得分越高"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/search.md:0
msgid "Recency"
msgstr "时效性"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/search.md:0
msgid "up to 30%"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/search.md:0
msgid ""
"Linearly decays to 0 over 1 year old; a scene from today scores the full "
"0.3, a scene older than a year contributes 0"
msgstr "在 1 年内线性衰减至 0；今天的场景得满分 0.3，超过一年的场景贡献为 0"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/search.md:0
msgid "Processing level"
msgstr "处理级别"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/search.md:0
msgid "10% flat bonus"
msgstr "固定 10% 加成"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/search.md:0
msgid ""
"Applied if the scene is L2/L2A/L2SP/analysis-ready — not scaled, just added "
"or not"
msgstr "场景为 L2/L2A/L2SP/分析就绪级别时适用，不按比例缩放，只有加或不加"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/search.md:0
msgid "*(baseline)*"
msgstr "*（基线）*"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/search.md:0
msgid "50%→60% blended with cloud score"
msgstr "50%→60%，与云量得分混合"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/search.md:0
msgid "Every result starts at a neutral 0.5 baseline"
msgstr "每个结果都从中性的 0.5 基线开始"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/search.md:37
msgid "Deduplication is only provider+ID based"
msgstr "去重仅基于提供方与 ID"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/search.md:39
msgid ""
"**Limitation.** Deduplication is based on provider and ID only. If two "
"*different* providers index the same scene (for example `aws_earth` and "
"`planetary_computer` both carry the same Sentinel-2 tile), you get **both "
"copies**. There is no cross-provider matching by acquisition ID or by "
"footprint and datetime. When searching overlapping STAC catalogues, de-"
"duplicate on your own key, such as the Sentinel-2 granule ID."
msgstr ""
"**限制。**去重仅基于提供方和 ID。如果两个*不同*的提供方索引了同一个场景（例如 `aws_earth` 和 "
"`planetary_computer` 都提供同一个 Sentinel-2 图块），您会得到**两份副本**。系统不会按采集 ID "
"或按覆盖范围与日期时间进行跨提供方匹配。检索重叠的 STAC 目录时，请使用您自己的键（例如 Sentinel-2 granule ID）进行去重。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/search.md:45
msgid "Scoring uses three factors"
msgstr "评分使用三个因子"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/search.md:47
msgid ""
"The scoring function's docstring lists a fourth factor, spatial coverage "
"(0.2 weight), but the implementation does not apply it. The score uses only "
"cloud cover, recency and processing level, as shown above. AOI coverage is "
"available separately as a hard filter through [optical validation](optical-"
"validation.md) (`check_aoi_coverage`), not as a scoring input."
msgstr ""
"评分函数的文档字符串列出了第四个因子，即空间覆盖（权重 0.2），但实现中并未应用。如上所示，评分只使用云量、时效性和处理级别。AOI "
"覆盖可通过[光学验证](optical-"
"validation.md)（`check_aoi_coverage`）单独作为硬性过滤条件使用，而不是评分的输入。"

